{"person":"person:canon:azhu","as_name":"黄衫丑少女","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:juxianzhuang","believed_by":["*"],"ch":[19,19],"b":"text","e":[[19,73,76,85,"c2cbcf32361c1a69"]],"note":"为免薛神医因慕容氏的缘故拒不医治，在车中改了面貌，颧骨高耸、衣着寻常；到聚贤庄众人都当她是寻常少女"}
{"person":"person:canon:azhu","as_name":"少林僧虚清","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:shaolinsi","believed_by":["person:canon:xuanci","person:canon:xuannan","person:canon:xuanji"],"as_person":"person:canon:xuqing","ch":[18,19],"b":"text","e":[[19,91,48,65,"7baf90a7e2870a86"],[19,84,17,26,"b59299c04e3c5b79"],[19,85,48,61,"5c869b00b2e52c9c"]],"note":"前晚在少林寺扮作僧人虚清，被乔峰带走；少林三僧只见一僧被掳，事后清点全寺却无人缺失，对不上号"}
